### Get all Incident Severity -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/incident-severity-levels

###

### Create Incident Severity -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/incident-severity-levels
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "level_name": "Test",
    "chart_lock_trigger": false
}

###

### Update Incident Severity -> 200 OK
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/incident-severity-levels/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "level_name": "Low Updated",
    "chart_lock_trigger": true
}

### Update Incident Severity -> 400 Bad Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/incident-severity-levels/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "level_name": "",
    "chart_lock_trigger": true
}

### Update ID with non-existing ID -> 404 Not Found
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/incident-severity-levels/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "level_name":"ABC",
    "chart_lock_trigger":true
}